§ `Tests -- every constructor declared in snap3-s2016-h.l4 is built once`

#ASSERT `make the stored benefits available to the household` EQUALS `make the stored benefits available to the household`
#ASSERT `provide sufficient notice to the household that benefits will be expunged due to inactivity` EQUALS `provide sufficient notice to the household that benefits will be expunged due to inactivity`
#ASSERT NOT (`make the stored benefits available to the household` EQUALS `provide sufficient notice to the household that benefits will be expunged due to inactivity`)
